	(descr "ST PowerFLAT 5x6 type R (STL90N10F7, ST DocID024551 Rev 6 Fig. 20 recommended footprint, 1.27 mm pitch): four 0.65 x 1.15 mm lead pads (S,S,S,G) on one side, one drain pad trimmed to 4.525 x 4.41 mm (the figure shows 4.60 wide x 4.65 long with three relief notches; trimmed by 0.095 mm per side across and 0.125 mm on the lead side, solid rectangle, to keep 0.2 mm clearance to the finished shunt sense tracks, so the lead-to-drain gap is 0.925 mm instead of 0.80). Pad set 6.60 mm overall, 3.81 mm lead pitch span. Drawn from the datasheet figure; the pin-1 marker and courtyard follow KiCad TDSON-8-1.")
